43:37.005 --> 43:37.832
- Bumalik ka sa loob!

43:38.050 --> 43:39.007
Mary!

43:39.225 --> 43:40.095
Mary!

43:43.621 --> 43:44.883
Bumaba ka na.

43:45.100 --> 43:46.058
