50:33.421 --> 50:34.683
Long overdue.

50:34.901 --> 50:38.687
[Nagsasalita si Lin sa
wikang banyaga]

50:38.905 --> 50:39.819
- Hell oo.

50:40.994 --> 50:43.518
[malumanay na musika]

50:46.869 --> 50:48.175
[Bumuntong hininga si Thomas]

50:50.264 --> 50:51.744
- Sige, kung gayon.

50:52.005 --> 50:54.877
[tuloy ang musika]

50:57.576 --> 51:02.407
[kumakaluskos ng apoy]
[tulo ng tubig]

51:13.896 --> 51:14.767
Hey.

51:16.508 --> 51:17.204
ano pangalan mo

51:17.465 --> 51:18.597
- Gracie.

51:18.814 --> 51:20.033
