na maunawaan ito

58:10.269 --> 58:11.966
'cause it don't make no
God damn sense to me.

58:12.227 --> 58:15.840
[pattering ng ulan]

58:16.101 --> 58:18.756
[kulog na dumadagundong]

58:24.370 --> 58:26.111
[Napabuntong-hininga si Thomas]

58:28.896 --> 58:30.768
